                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's fine at best. Very much on par with flash games of yore. I have a couple problems with it I can't look past though.\n\n - This game needs VSync or frame limitation. Badly. I don't need to be blasting this at 2000 fps so my GPU starts cooking.\n - The paddle has a limiter on how fast it can move, which is wildly unnecessary\n - Some of the physics are funky\n\nI paid $1 for it, so I'm not mad, but these are relatively basic things that can be fixed by the developer. Definitely feels like a first game sort of situation.",
